From 1632ee1a5d0c34e80a5c2090c532a6547818a1ca Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yumi-Lab <nicolas@yumi-lab.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 23:29:11 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Kconfig: use 'help', '---help---' is rejected since Linux
 5.8

Only the in-tree build reads this Kconfig, and its parser no longer accepts
the old spelling.
---
 Kconfig | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/Kconfig b/Kconfig
index 013175c..8aa24b1 100644
--- a/Kconfig
+++ b/Kconfig
@@ -1,6 +1,6 @@
 config RTL8188EU
 	tristate "Realtek 8188E USB WiFi"
 	depends on USB
-	---help---
+	help
 	  Help message of RTL8188EU
 
